From 9ad8f372b2bb6a5765c8d756fe690e7754857a09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tillmann Severin <tillmann.severin@mailbox.org>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 20:01:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 14/24] ARM: multi_v7_defconfig: enable Hi3798MV200

Enable the machine and the peripherals it needs that were not already
selected: the SoC specific dw_mmc extension for SD and eMMC, the hix5hd2
I2C controller and the Realtek PHY driver used by the gigabit MAC.

CONFIG_HIX5HD2_GMAC is already enabled, and COMMON_CLK_HI3798MV200 is
selected automatically by its "default ARCH_HISI".

The hix5hd2 IR receiver is not enabled here because multi_v7_defconfig
does not build the remote control core at all; enabling it would pull in
a new subsystem for one driver.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 arch/arm/configs/multi_v7_defconfig | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/configs/multi_v7_defconfig b/arch/arm/configs/multi_v7_defconfig
index 2707c4c50226..7f304368d2d3 100644
--- a/arch/arm/configs/multi_v7_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm/configs/multi_v7_defconfig
@@ -47,6 +47,7 @@ CONFIG_ARCH_EXYNOS=y
 CONFIG_ARCH_HIGHBANK=y
 CONFIG_ARCH_HISI=y
 CONFIG_ARCH_HI3xxx=y
+CONFIG_ARCH_HI3798MV200=y
 CONFIG_ARCH_HIP01=y
 CONFIG_ARCH_HIP04=y
 CONFIG_ARCH_HIX5HD2=y
@@ -287,6 +288,7 @@ CONFIG_BROADCOM_PHY=y
 CONFIG_ICPLUS_PHY=y
 CONFIG_MARVELL_PHY=y
 CONFIG_AT803X_PHY=y
+CONFIG_REALTEK_PHY=y
 CONFIG_ROCKCHIP_PHY=y
 CONFIG_DP83867_PHY=y
 CONFIG_CAN_AT91=m
@@ -406,6 +408,7 @@ CONFIG_I2C_MUX_GPIO=y
 CONFIG_I2C_MUX_PCA954x=y
 CONFIG_I2C_MUX_PINCTRL=y
 CONFIG_I2C_DEMUX_PINCTRL=y
+CONFIG_I2C_HIX5HD2=y
 CONFIG_I2C_ASPEED=m
 CONFIG_I2C_AT91=m
 CONFIG_I2C_BCM2835=y
@@ -958,6 +961,7 @@ CONFIG_MMC_SDHI=y
 CONFIG_MMC_UNIPHIER=y
 CONFIG_MMC_DW=y
 CONFIG_MMC_DW_EXYNOS=y
+CONFIG_MMC_DW_HI3798MV200=y
 CONFIG_MMC_DW_ROCKCHIP=y
 CONFIG_MMC_SH_MMCIF=y
 CONFIG_MMC_SUNXI=y
@@ -1207,6 +1211,7 @@ CONFIG_RESET_TI_SYSCON=m
 CONFIG_PHY_SUN4I_USB=y
 CONFIG_PHY_SUN9I_USB=y
 CONFIG_PHY_BRCM_USB=m
+CONFIG_PHY_HISI_INNO_USB2=y
 CONFIG_PHY_HIX5HD2_SATA=y
 CONFIG_PHY_BERLIN_SATA=y
 CONFIG_PHY_BERLIN_USB=y
